    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00563",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“哪有多少财产可言哪，还不是这样将就着打发日子呀。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "There is hardly any property worth speaking of; we are just getting by like this.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00563",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "我跟你说，这些都不重要，重要的是，你以后可是一定要做点事情才行。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Let me tell you, none of that really matters; what matters is that from now on you must do something with yourself.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00563",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "像先生这样闲待着……”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If you just idle around like Sensei...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00564",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“我可没有闲待着噢。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I am not idling around.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00565",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "先生稍稍扭过脸来，打断了夫人的话。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Sensei turned his face slightly and cut off his wife's words.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
